Subject: [PATCH] net: export scheduler shutdown for NSS wireless ndo_stop

NSS wireless interfaces must destroy their inactive shapers before ndo_stop
unregisters the firmware control interface. Their FREE command and DMA drain
cannot be deferred to unregister_netdevice's later dev_shutdown call.

--- a/net/sched/sch_generic.c
+++ b/net/sched/sch_generic.c
@@ -1477,6 +1477,7 @@ void dev_shutdown(struct net_device *dev)
 
 	WARN_ON(timer_pending(&dev->watchdog_timer));
 }
+EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(dev_shutdown);
 
 /**
  * psched_ratecfg_precompute__() - Pre-compute values for reciprocal division
